# Accepted residual risk: ecdsa 0.19.2 / PYSEC-2026-1325 (Minerva timing attack
# on ECDSA signing). No fix version exists - upstream considers side-channel
# resistance out of scope. Reached only via python-jose, and this app signs JWTs
# with HS256 (see Settings.algorithm), so no ECDSA signing or key generation
# runs. Revisit by migrating python-jose -> PyJWT, which does not pull ecdsa.

